WEBVTT

00:07.820 --> 00:12.240
Les Misérables

00:07.820 --> 00:12.240
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.780 --> 00:11.780
Beyond the wind

00:12.240 --> 00:15.660
The wind blows

00:12.240 --> 00:15.660
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.660 --> 00:22.290
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.660 --> 00:22.290
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.290 --> 00:25.830
I held my knees

00:22.290 --> 00:25.830
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.830 --> 00:31.300
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.830 --> 00:31.300
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.300 --> 00:35.010
Far away, very far away

00:31.300 --> 00:35.010
Tooku haruka tooku

00:35.010 --> 00:41.640
A gentle voice is calling me

00:35.010 --> 00:41.640
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.640 --> 00:45.270
Let's go look for it

00:41.640 --> 00:45.270
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.270 --> 00:51.030
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.270 --> 00:51.030
Attemonai keredo

00:51.030 --> 00:55.780
The rain comes down

00:51.030 --> 00:55.780
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.780 --> 01:00.540
on a lonely morning

00:55.780 --> 01:00.540
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.540 --> 01:05.040
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.540 --> 01:05.040
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:05.040 --> 01:09.630
the sunlight is peering at us

01:05.040 --> 01:09.630
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.630 --> 01:12.010
Wipe away your tears

01:09.630 --> 01:12.010
Namida fuite

01:12.010 --> 01:14.970
Look forward

01:12.010 --> 01:14.970
Mae wo muite

01:14.970 --> 01:19.220
and summon all of your strength

01:14.970 --> 01:19.220
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.220 --> 01:21.600
Let's walk

01:19.220 --> 01:21.600
Aruite yukou

01:21.600 --> 01:23.980
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.600 --> 01:23.980
Kitto yukeru

01:23.980 --> 01:31.360
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.980 --> 01:31.360
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.360 --> 01:34.400
forever...

01:31.360 --> 01:34.400
Dokomademo

01:53.560 --> 01:56.870
<i>Cosette. My lovely Cosette.</i>

01:57.480 --> 02:03.840
<i>Before I come to fetch you, you have to listen
to Monsieur Thénardier and be a good girl.</i>

02:04.530 --> 02:09.220
<i>I'm always thinking of you, my beloved Cosette.</i>

02:10.120 --> 02:11.760
<i>With all my love, Fantine.</i>

02:12.120 --> 02:19.480
<i>To the kind Thénardier and his wife: Please convey
this letter to Cosette who still cannot read.</i>

02:19.920 --> 02:21.770
<i>I send my thanks in advance.</i>

02:21.780 --> 02:26.790
Mother's Letter

02:33.260 --> 02:34.870
It's here! It's here!

02:34.930 --> 02:37.010
It has arrived!

02:37.430 --> 02:39.830
It's the letter sent from Montreuil-sur-Mer!

02:43.820 --> 02:45.960
We'll be able to make big money if we have this person.

02:45.980 --> 02:47.020
It's a letter from Mother.

02:47.320 --> 02:49.880
I have a good money-making plan, Gavroche.

02:50.200 --> 02:54.050
We'll sell the cheap wheat bread at twice the
cost. This way we can rake in big profits!

02:54.790 --> 03:00.480
If I use this money as the deposit and persuade others to join
in, we'll be able to pay off the ever-swelling debt in a jiffy.

03:00.500 --> 03:02.190
Am I right, Azelma?

03:02.330 --> 03:04.690
I hate the hard wheat bread.

03:05.250 --> 03:07.070
I can't stay here idling.

03:07.380 --> 03:08.360
I'm going out!

03:11.180 --> 03:14.240
Dear, you're not eating your breakfast?!

03:15.310 --> 03:16.200
Cosette!

03:26.110 --> 03:29.380
You tried to steal Azelma's bread just now, right?

03:29.650 --> 03:31.470
I didn't...

03:33.660 --> 03:35.680
Gosh. What a nasty child.

03:35.700 --> 03:37.810
'Cosette stole my bread!

03:39.790 --> 03:45.400
Oh my poor Azelma. Don't worry, your bread is right here.

03:45.540 --> 03:46.980
I hate the hard wheat bread.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.230
Azelma is a liar.

03:51.720 --> 03:53.240
Why are you idling there?!

03:54.390 --> 03:56.530
Once you're done with the shop, clean the outside!

04:00.390 --> 04:04.890
How did the useless child grow up to be even more useless? Geez...

04:14.740 --> 04:16.140
Hello.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.390
Oh my...

04:18.030 --> 04:19.260
What a nice smile.

04:19.580 --> 04:22.890
You're the new priest? Such a young lad.

04:23.330 --> 04:29.110
Yes. There is going to be a church service next
Sunday, so please bring your family over.

04:29.590 --> 04:33.990
Thank you for informing me. Are you going
to inform the others house by house?

04:35.010 --> 04:38.490
I feel that doing that would allow me to be acquainted with the village sooner.

04:39.600 --> 04:43.000
But I'm afraid I won't be able to cover the whole area in a day.

04:43.190 --> 04:47.080
Oh, there is a place called the Waterloo Inn up ahead.

04:47.110 --> 04:48.250
Waterloo Inn?

04:48.820 --> 04:53.480
The couple at that place have taken in a rather poor child.

04:53.990 --> 04:59.720
There are still kind people in this tough world.

05:02.500 --> 05:07.190
It would have been nice if I got a hold of it. I wonder what was in the letter?

05:08.000 --> 05:09.690
Can you read, Cosette?

05:09.960 --> 05:11.070
I can't read.

05:11.740 --> 05:12.540
What?

05:15.300 --> 05:17.660
But if I can read Mother's letter...

05:18.760 --> 05:19.870
Gavroche!

05:21.350 --> 05:23.260
Your face is all black!

05:26.190 --> 05:27.790
Éponine can read.

05:28.020 --> 05:28.750
Really?

05:30.020 --> 05:31.920
Wanna get Éponine to read it?

05:33.070 --> 05:34.710
Do you think she would read it?

05:35.070 --> 05:36.840
Then, shall we go, find Chou Chou?

05:36.860 --> 05:39.180
Chou Chou can't read, right?

05:39.200 --> 05:40.390
I'll go see Chou Chou!

05:40.830 --> 05:41.390
Okay.

05:52.920 --> 05:55.250
Did you know a new priest has arrived here?

05:55.670 --> 05:57.210
Oh, a priest?

05:57.550 --> 06:02.530
Ever since the previous priest died of illness, they
had not appointed a new priest until now.

06:03.060 --> 06:04.200
Was that the case?

06:04.560 --> 06:08.680
My parents are grateful because they can go to the church at last.

06:09.100 --> 06:11.130
You don't go to church, Éponine?

06:11.520 --> 06:15.050
Go to the church? I'll do it if you ask me, Toron.

06:17.610 --> 06:19.130
Well then, I'm going this way.

06:19.570 --> 06:20.470
See you tomorrow.

06:20.870 --> 06:22.550
Ah, see you tomorrow!

06:24.830 --> 06:26.810
See you later, Toron!

06:28.500 --> 06:30.270
See you later!

06:48.480 --> 06:49.410
Welcome back.

06:52.400 --> 06:56.000
Can you clean my shoes? I got them dirty when I walked on the mud.

07:02.200 --> 07:03.140
What?

07:03.160 --> 07:05.570
Your shoes will be clean if you rub them with these.

07:07.500 --> 07:08.770
Mother!

07:09.000 --> 07:11.140
Cosette is being mean to me!

07:18.550 --> 07:20.740
I can't ride that swing anymore...

07:25.060 --> 07:28.760
How is it? Mother, I wrote all of them.

07:29.600 --> 07:33.210
You're remarkable. You're so pretty and you can read.

07:33.230 --> 07:37.340
You'd be able to snag a gentleman loaded
with money for your husband, Éponine.

07:37.940 --> 07:41.940
It's fine with me if I can't snag a gentleman
loaded with money for my husband...

07:41.950 --> 07:43.430
What are you saying?

07:43.450 --> 07:46.890
Even if you don't wish for one, marriage proposals will fly to you.

07:48.290 --> 07:50.350
Mama! Do it to me too!

07:50.540 --> 07:51.950
Come over here, Azelma.

07:53.420 --> 07:54.350
Yes!

07:54.380 --> 07:58.790
Azelma is also a pretty girl, so rich gentlemen won't ignore you.

07:58.800 --> 08:01.280
Azelma should learn to read too.

08:01.630 --> 08:03.700
I want to go to school too!

08:03.720 --> 08:05.490
Just wait until you're a little older.

08:05.970 --> 08:10.450
<i>If I learn to read, I'll be able to read Mother's letter.</i>

08:14.310 --> 08:15.500
What are you looking at?!

08:15.520 --> 08:18.000
If you're done sweeping, go and clean the guest rooms on the second floor!

08:18.020 --> 08:19.590
How many times do I have to say it?!

08:19.940 --> 08:21.670
Hurry up and start cleaning!

08:28.200 --> 08:31.640
Rich people won't be interested in Cosette, right?

08:32.040 --> 08:33.450
Yes! Of course not!

08:40.550 --> 08:41.230
Here.

08:41.260 --> 08:42.940
Thank you, Mademoiselle Fantine.

08:43.800 --> 08:45.200
It's the chime for the end of work.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.680
Thank you very much.

09:01.280 --> 09:03.590
I did so much work. I'm completely exhausted.

09:03.700 --> 09:04.800
You'll get used to it.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.970
Please teach me more.

09:11.200 --> 09:12.470
Fantine!

09:14.330 --> 09:15.310
I'm sorry.

09:16.420 --> 09:17.480
Thank you very much.

09:24.420 --> 09:25.820
Mademoiselle Fantine!

09:30.760 --> 09:33.910
Mademoiselle Fantine, are you free later?

09:33.930 --> 09:34.790
Is there something the matter?

09:35.310 --> 09:37.830
Let's go and have a nice meal.

09:39.690 --> 09:41.960
I have something I need to do.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.590
I'm sorry.

09:47.950 --> 09:49.590
It's no use asking her.

09:50.620 --> 09:53.060
She said she can't socialize with us.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.600
She puts on airs.

09:55.040 --> 09:58.910
Fantine might be hiding work that can't be talked about in public.

10:16.350 --> 10:18.370
That pink ribbon would be nice!

10:22.820 --> 10:28.550
<i>Cosette, wait for me. I'll definitely fetch you before your next birthday.</i>

10:30.570 --> 10:32.610
<i>What should I buy for a present?</i>

10:32.910 --> 10:34.100
<i>A yummy sweet?</i>

10:34.120 --> 10:36.720
<i>A pretty dress with lace?</i>

10:37.160 --> 10:39.890
<i>Or how about a lovely doll?</i>

10:48.420 --> 10:50.110
You bastard! Stop there!

11:03.270 --> 11:04.040
Let me go!

11:04.070 --> 11:05.420
Hey, stay still!

11:05.940 --> 11:10.130
Hear me out! I was just resting in front of that shop!

11:10.150 --> 11:11.760
I didn't do anything illegal!

11:12.320 --> 11:13.720
Why did you run away then?

11:14.080 --> 11:15.100
You ask why?

11:15.120 --> 11:18.890
Well, if the police comes chasing after me suddenly,
I'd run away in fright, wouldn't I?!

11:18.910 --> 11:22.940
You look similar to one of the robbers who
committed a robbery in the next town.

11:23.330 --> 11:24.650
I'm not!

11:25.090 --> 11:27.070
I'll hear you out at the police headquarters.

11:27.510 --> 11:28.780
W-Wait!

11:29.220 --> 11:30.570
I'm really not one of them!

11:30.590 --> 11:32.070
Hey! Hey!

11:40.390 --> 11:43.540
<i>Speaking of which, he is so like that prisoner.</i>

11:48.320 --> 11:53.900
The other day, the mayor gave the chimney-sweeper child some pocket money.

11:54.490 --> 11:56.050
Chimney-sweeper child?

11:57.620 --> 12:00.640
In fact, there are a ton of other people who are in need.

12:00.910 --> 12:04.730
Say, Inspector... the means in which he obtained his wealth is dubious.

12:04.750 --> 12:08.650
I feel that man has a hidden background.

12:08.670 --> 12:09.540
What led you to think that way?

12:09.550 --> 12:12.990
It's intuition. I had worked as a notary long ago.

12:13.590 --> 12:16.490
All of the people on the streets are taken in by his lies.

12:16.510 --> 12:21.660
They revere that unknown man as if he's the Messiah.

12:21.680 --> 12:25.670
Yet, this pitiable old man has to ride on the wagon day after day...

12:25.690 --> 12:30.170
If you are going to keep accusing the mayor,
I'll hear the rest at the police headquarters.

12:40.290 --> 12:41.280
Wait!

12:44.330 --> 12:46.690
Didn't I say you can't come along?

12:47.290 --> 12:48.730
Let's go together.

12:49.420 --> 12:51.320
Look. Even Chou Chou came along.

12:51.710 --> 12:55.450
I'm going to be back as soon as I give Éponine the things she left behind.

12:55.590 --> 12:58.280
Okay? Gavroche, wait for me at home.

12:58.300 --> 12:59.620
I want to go with Cosette!

13:02.770 --> 13:04.470
I suppose I can't help it.

13:04.480 --> 13:05.330
Well then, take my hand.

13:18.240 --> 13:21.260
"Mère, père, bébé" (Mother, father, baby.)

13:27.210 --> 13:28.150
There she is!

13:31.000 --> 13:33.190
"Chien, chat, cheval." (Dog, cat, horse.)

13:33.500 --> 13:35.210
"Fleur, arbre." (Flower, tree.)

13:35.970 --> 13:38.110
"Chien, chat, cheval." (Dog, cat, horse.)

13:41.180 --> 13:42.950
Hey, is Éponine in there?

13:45.640 --> 13:46.830
Hey, Cosette.

13:47.600 --> 13:50.670
Shhh! Gavroche, be quiet. Chou Chou, be quiet too.

13:51.320 --> 13:54.920
Now, can you remember how to write the vocabulary words?

13:55.240 --> 13:56.340
Well then, Éponine.

13:56.740 --> 13:57.380
Yes.

13:59.620 --> 14:00.470
This is?

14:00.490 --> 14:01.150
Um...

14:01.580 --> 14:02.320
"Chat." (Cat.)

14:06.620 --> 14:08.060
You are correct.

14:08.670 --> 14:09.940
Well then, the next one would be...

14:10.290 --> 14:13.020
Who shall I get to write?

14:20.970 --> 14:22.910
Where did you all come from?

14:25.520 --> 14:26.700
Éponine!

14:27.940 --> 14:28.870
You two...

14:30.480 --> 14:31.750
What are you doing?!

14:32.690 --> 14:34.460
I came to deliver this.

14:34.820 --> 14:36.020
It's bread and apples.

14:36.900 --> 14:37.590
Gosh!

14:38.240 --> 14:40.260
I told you I don't need them today!

14:40.870 --> 14:42.220
Is she your little sister?

14:42.700 --> 14:47.270
How can she be? She's just left in the care of my family as she is rather poor.

14:47.540 --> 14:48.640
Is that so?

14:50.580 --> 14:52.190
You're so young; it must be tough.

14:52.540 --> 14:54.190
Yes. Um... it's nothing...

14:54.500 --> 14:58.070
How old are you? You don't go to school?

14:59.550 --> 15:01.170
Let's go back, Gavroche.

15:01.380 --> 15:01.960
Okay.

15:03.640 --> 15:05.370
You're going back already?

15:05.930 --> 15:07.080
See you later!

15:10.520 --> 15:12.580
"Chien, chat, cheval." (Dog, cat, horse.)

15:12.610 --> 15:14.420
"Fleur, arbre." (Flower, tree.)

15:14.440 --> 15:16.090
"Chien, chat, cheval." (Dog, cat, horse.)

15:16.270 --> 15:17.350
"Fleur, arbre." (Flower, tree.)

15:18.070 --> 15:19.760
"Chien." (Dog.)

15:19.770 --> 15:21.020
"Chat." (Cat.)

15:21.030 --> 15:22.340
"Cheval." (Horse.)

15:23.240 --> 15:24.800
"Fleur." (Flower.)

15:28.250 --> 15:29.240
"Arbre." (Tree.)

15:30.870 --> 15:32.190
"Belle! Bon!" (Beautiful! Good!)

15:32.210 --> 15:32.910
"Bon!" (Good!)

15:33.170 --> 15:33.900
"Belle!" (Beautiful!)

15:39.420 --> 15:40.360
Are you all right?

15:40.630 --> 15:41.650
Priest...

15:41.970 --> 15:45.740
You looked really happy. But it's dangerous if you don't look in front of you.

15:46.310 --> 15:47.160
I'm sorry.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.830
We were studying!

15:49.180 --> 15:49.830
Studying?

15:50.230 --> 15:55.000
Um... I thought it'd be great if I can read letters.

15:55.440 --> 15:58.090
But I don't go to school...

15:59.070 --> 16:00.670
What's your name?

16:01.240 --> 16:02.220
Cosette.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.260
Just a moment...

16:10.830 --> 16:13.020
Cosette. This is your name.

16:16.500 --> 16:19.040
Co-se-tte.

16:25.260 --> 16:26.130
Hey, bring the wine.

16:26.140 --> 16:27.240
We don't have any left!

16:28.890 --> 16:31.660
We've long used up the money for Cosette's living expenses.

16:31.730 --> 16:35.790
Shut up. The damn bastard ran away with the money I left with him.

16:35.810 --> 16:36.580
What did you say?!

16:36.900 --> 16:39.090
I shouldn't have trusted that guy!

16:37.550 --> 16:39.670
I got the doll!

16:39.110 --> 16:40.970
He got your every sou?!

16:39.730 --> 16:41.480
Mama!

16:41.490 --> 16:43.010
Hasn't Cosette come back?

16:43.030 --> 16:46.640
Yeah. Geez... it's so late. Where did she go?

16:48.410 --> 16:50.140
When she comes back, remember to punish her.

16:50.160 --> 16:53.850
I was so embarrassed by Cosette today!

16:55.290 --> 16:58.270
I'm going to punish her properly today!

16:58.670 --> 17:01.940
I'm going to give that brat a good beating.

17:01.960 --> 17:02.940
It has become really late.

17:03.380 --> 17:04.150
I wonder if we'll get scolded.

17:04.220 --> 17:06.450
They're finally back.

17:07.220 --> 17:09.950
What time do you think...

17:13.480 --> 17:15.460
I apologize for intruding this late.

17:16.900 --> 17:17.580
Yes...

17:18.230 --> 17:18.920
You're...

17:19.400 --> 17:22.130
Today's the first time I've met you.

17:22.190 --> 17:26.220
I'm Richard. I was transferred to the church here a few days ago.

17:26.610 --> 17:28.340
He's the Priest whom Toron spoke of.

17:28.530 --> 17:29.390
Priest?

17:29.410 --> 17:30.890
Why are you together with Cosette?

17:31.160 --> 17:37.020
After I delivered the thing Éponine left behind to her school,
I decided to take a shortcut and I passed by the church...

17:37.040 --> 17:39.120
And then we met the priest.

17:39.420 --> 17:42.980
The shortcut you took is really a long one, Cosette.

17:43.260 --> 17:44.440
I'm sorry.

17:44.470 --> 17:49.160
I talked with these children and I unintentionally dragged it for too long.

17:49.600 --> 17:51.620
I must have made you worry.

17:51.640 --> 17:54.290
O-Oh... don't worry about it!

17:54.310 --> 17:58.870
We're like her parents after we took her in.

17:58.900 --> 18:03.460
We were discussing about going to the police.

18:03.480 --> 18:05.840
Thank goodness you're safe, Cosette.

18:08.530 --> 18:11.890
Priest, thank you for taking your time to bring the children back.

18:12.450 --> 18:14.180
Thank you very much.

18:14.580 --> 18:15.990
We don't have anything to serve you.

18:16.000 --> 18:21.230
I've heard that there is a kind couple who have adopted a poor child.

18:22.550 --> 18:24.610
I'm glad you were like what I have heard.

18:24.630 --> 18:25.400
Oh my.

18:26.300 --> 18:29.170
We're just doing things we are supposed to do.

18:31.300 --> 18:32.910
There will be a church service this Sunday.

18:32.930 --> 18:35.830
If you have the time, please come to the church.

18:36.100 --> 18:39.040
Yes, we'll certainly come.

18:41.980 --> 18:44.210
Well then, please excuse us.

19:06.260 --> 19:08.400
You thought you'd get scolded so you brought along the Bishop.

19:08.420 --> 19:10.450
You're a sly girl, Cosette.

19:10.760 --> 19:15.490
I was so embarrassed when Cosette came to my school in such tattered clothes.

19:16.680 --> 19:18.750
Cosette only has tattered clothes to wear...

19:18.810 --> 19:21.210
The rest of the clothes are all worn by you and Azelma.

19:21.230 --> 19:22.890
Gavroche, you're going to get it later.

19:22.900 --> 19:24.350
Get it later.

19:25.070 --> 19:29.300
Cosette, how much more trouble are you
going to bring us until you re satisfied?

19:29.320 --> 19:33.510
Your mother left you in our care for only a small amount of money.

19:33.530 --> 19:36.970
So if you don't work harder, we won't be able to make ends meet.

19:37.120 --> 19:38.060
Yes...

19:38.290 --> 19:44.690
That's right. Write a letter to Cosette's mother to
have her raise the living expenses to 10 francs.

19:45.420 --> 19:50.190
That's a good idea. We should have more since she brings us so much trouble.

19:50.220 --> 19:52.610
You're right. Okay, let's do this.

19:57.100 --> 19:57.910
Where are you going?

19:58.770 --> 20:02.500
Um... the fire in the hearth has died out, so I'm going out to get firewood.

20:03.770 --> 20:07.000
On your way, carry all the firewood from the storeroom to the kitchen.

20:07.570 --> 20:09.770
You're not getting your dinner tonight! You got that?!

20:25.170 --> 20:26.520
I'm finally done...

20:31.590 --> 20:32.360
Cosette.

20:35.140 --> 20:35.910
Here's some bread.

20:36.930 --> 20:37.530
Thank you.

21:10.960 --> 21:13.360
Look. "Cosette" is written here.

21:14.380 --> 21:16.450
"Cosette" is written here...

21:17.390 --> 21:18.530
This spot too.

21:23.480 --> 21:24.370
Mother...

21:27.560 --> 21:29.210
Hurry up and fetch me.

22:13.680 --> 22:16.690
ma maman (my mother)

